  "durationSeconds": 45.625,
  "caption": "That’s when you know it is really over",
  "transcript": {
    "text": "When a man replaces you with peace and not another woman, it is really over, because now you are not competing with somebody prettier. You are not competing with somebody younger. You are now competing with how good his life feels without the chaos. He sleeps better. He thinks clear. He doesn't have to explain himself every 5 minutes or wonder what version of you he's getting today. And once a man realizes that being alone feels better than being with you, getting him back becomes almost impossible because another woman can disappoint him, but peace, peace does not disappoint a man. Sometimes a relationship doesn't end because he found somebody better. Often times that's not the case. It ends because he finally realized that being by himself was the best thing he could have ever done. Love y'all. Peace.",
